{
  "name": "[Unit 2] First Workflow - Notion Trigger Hello World",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Unit 2: 第一個工作流 - Notion Trigger Hello World\n\n### 目的\n當 Notion 知識庫資料庫新增一筆頁面時，自動觸發此工作流。\n\n### 流程說明\n1. **Notion Trigger** - 監聽 Notion 資料庫，偵測新增頁面事件\n2. **Set** - 擷取並正規化欄位（標題、建立時間、狀態）\n3. **NoOp** - 終點節點，用於檢視輸出結果\n\n### 使用前準備\n- 將 `YOUR_NOTION_KB_DATABASE_ID` 替換為你的 Notion 資料庫 ID\n- 設定 Notion API 憑證（`notion_api`）",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "pageAddedToDatabase",
        "databaseId": "YOUR_NOTION_KB_DATABASE_ID",
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "notion-trigger-1",
      "name": "Notion Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notionTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        450
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "notionApi": {
          "id": "notion_api",
          "name": "notion_api"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.properties.Name.title[0].plain_text }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-created-time",
              "name": "created_time",
              "value": "={{ $json.created_time }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "NEW",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-1",
      "name": "Set Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        450
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "noop-1",
      "name": "Confirmation Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        750,
        450
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Notion Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Fields",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Fields": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Confirmation Output",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "staticData": null,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "triggerCount": 1,
  "tags": [],
  "active": false,
  "versionId": "1"
}
